<view class="root-page health-page">
  <view class="health-intro">
    <view class="health-kicker">MY HEALTH · ROOT</view>
    <view class="health-title">从了解当下开始</view>
    <view class="health-copy">通过经过审核的问卷记录近期状态，并在同一问卷版本下观察复测变化。结果仅供健康状态观察参考。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{viewState === 'loading'}}" class="root-card state-card">
    <view class="state-eyebrow">正在确认</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">正在读取你的健康旅程</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">加载过程不会创建新的健康记录。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{viewState === 'guest'}}" class="root-card state-card">
    <view class="state-eyebrow">需要登录</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">登录后查看健康旅程</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">未登录时仍可浏览首页、商品与公开活动；登录不会自动开启健康评测。</view><button class="root-button state-action" bindtap="goLogin">微信身份进入</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{viewState === 'accountRequired'}}" class="root-card state-card">
    <view class="state-eyebrow">需要完成账号资料</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">先完成账号资料</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">账号资料与健康信息分开处理。完成账号资料后，仍需单独确认健康信息处理说明。</view><button class="root-button state-action" bindtap="goRegister">继续完善账号</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{viewState === 'consentRequired'}}" class="root-card state-card">
    <view class="state-eyebrow">单独确认</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">确认健康信息处理方式后继续</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">评测答案属于健康相关敏感个人信息。你可以先查看处理目的、保存期限和退出方式，再自行决定。</view><button class="root-button state-action" bindtap="openConsent">查看并确认</button><button class="text-action" bindtap="openPrivacy">查看隐私说明</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{viewState === 'ready' || viewState === 'contentGated'}}">
    <view class="health-section-head"><view><view class="state-eyebrow">ASSESSMENTS</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">我的评测</view></view><button wx:if="{{historyCount}}" class="history-link" bindtap="openHistory">历史结果 {{historyCount}} ›</button></view>
    <view class="assessment-list">
      <view wx:for="{{assessments}}" wx:key="assessmentType" class="assessment-card assessment-card--{{item.assessmentType === 'INITIAL' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}">
        <view class="assessment-card__top"><view class="assessment-card__type">{{item.assessmentType === 'INITIAL' ? 'INITIAL' : 'GUT'}}</view><view class="assessment-status {{item.available ? 'is-ready' : ''}}">{{item.available ? (item.canResume ? '可继续' : (item.canRetest ? '可复测' : '可开始')) : item.unavailableText}}</view></view>
        <view class="assessment-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="assessment-copy">{{item.description}}</view>
        <view class="assessment-meta"><text wx:if="{{item.estimatedText}}">{{item.estimatedText}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.definition.questionnaireVersion}}">问卷 v{{item.definition.questionnaireVersion}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.historyCount}}">{{item.historyCount}} 次记录</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.latest}}" class="latest-result" data-assessment-id="{{item.latest.assessmentId}}" bindtap="openLatest"><view><view class="latest-label">最近一次 · {{item.latest.completedAtText}}</view><view class="latest-title">{{item.latest.resultTitle}}</view></view><text>查看 ›</text></view>
        <button class="assessment-action {{item.available ? '' : 'is-disabled'}}" data-assessment-type="{{item.assessmentType}}" bindtap="beginAssessment" loading="{{startingType === item.assessmentType}}" disabled="{{!item.available || startingType}}">{{item.canResume ? '继续评测' : (item.canRetest ? '重新评测' : (item.available ? '开始评测' : item.unavailableText))}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{viewState === 'contentGated'}}" class="root-card review-note"><view class="state-eyebrow">内容门禁</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">评测内容仍在审核或配置中</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">未完成来源、专业与合规审核的题目和结果文案不会向用户开放，也不会启动健康信息写入。</view><button class="root-button root-button--secondary state-action" bindtap="openPrivacy">查看隐私说明</button></view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="root-card state-card"><view class="state-eyebrow">读取失败</view><view class="root-section-title state-title">健康旅程暂时无法加载</view><view class="root-helper-text state-copy">{{errorText}}</view><button class="root-button root-button--secondary state-action" bindtap="loadShell">重新加载</button><button class="text-action" bindtap="openSupport">联系人工协助</button></view>
  <view class="health-note"><view class="health-note-mark"></view><view>本页不提供疾病诊断、治疗方案或紧急医疗处置。如有明显或持续不适，请及时寻求专业帮助。</view></view>
</view>
<campaign-popup id="campaign-popup" />
